              Digital marketing in 2026 costs anywhere from <strong>USD 500/month to USD 50,000+/month</strong> depending on the channel mix, agency seniority, and your geography. A small business doing local SEO might land at USD 800-1,500/month. A scaling D2C brand running Meta Ads, SEO, and email might spend USD 5,000-15,000/month. Below are the actual ranges by service and region, with the honesty most agencies skip.
